---
description: Image privacy and logging
alwaysApply: true
---
- Treat uploaded images as sensitive. Don't persist originals unless the user explicitly saves them.
- Never log image bytes, base64, OCR text, private image URLs, tokens, search history, user notes, or credentials.
- `RecognitionRequest` is intentionally not `Codable` and redacts its description — keep it that way.
- No provider API keys in the app; remote calls go through a backend proxy (M7).
- No silent retries of expensive analysis. No silent failures.
